--[[
    =====================================================================
     TOURNAMENT OF POWER  -  EVENT 2  -  CINEMATIC REWORK
    =====================================================================
    Flow:  chat trigger -> teleport (frozen + hidden) -> cutscene
           -> camera handed back -> BEGIN!

    How the file is organised (top to bottom):
      1. CONFIG     every tunable lives here (your original constants are kept)
      2. TOOLKIT    Maid (cleanup), easing, camera path builders, SFX
      3. DIALOGUE   KJ typed-letter module (unchanged) + Dragon Ball styles
      4. CHARACTER  teleport VFX, hide / reveal, spot assignment (unchanged)
      5. TRIGGER    Event:Start waits for the chat phrase (unchanged)
      6. CUTSCENE   built as small systems, all driven by ONE clock:
            clock/rig  -> one render step: animations, waits, camera
            gui        -> bars, speed lines, impact frames, stamps, vignette
            post fx    -> colour grade, bloom, blur, DoF, atmosphere
            world fx   -> rings, domes, lightning, debris, ki orb, pillar
            shots      -> data tables (path + fov + roll + timed CUES)
            sequence   -> shot list + transitions + finale
            cleanup    -> always runs, restores EVERYTHING

    Adding a shot = adding one table. Adding an effect on a beat = adding
    one { time, function } entry to that shot's `cues`.
    =====================================================================
]]

